WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.958
A child can have poor tissue perfusion while systolic

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:04.713
pressure remains appropriate for age.

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:06.888
This is compensated shock.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.329
Watch peripheral flow decrease
as blood is redistributed.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.627
A normal pressure reading
does not erase abnormal perfusion

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:14.068
findings.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.587
Hypotension marks a later category.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:20.612
Bradycardia in a severely
ill child can signal deterioration,

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.656
and hypoxia is a common cause.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.805
Assess oxygen delivery and perfusion together.
